{"title":"22","section":"3656","heading":"Uniform application of standards and rates","lead":"The standards established pursuant to section 3653 of this title and the rates of basic pay established pursuant to section 3642 of this title shall be applied without regard to whether the employee or individual concerned is a citizen of the United States or a citizen of the Republic of Panama.","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"amendments","text":"Amendments1997—Pub. L. 105–85 substituted “section 3642” for “section 3655”."}],"sourceCredit":"(Pub. L. 96–70, title I, § 1216, Sept. 27, 1979, 93 Stat. 465; Pub. L. 105–85, div. C, title XXXV, § 3523(c)(1), Nov. 18, 1997, 111 Stat. 2065.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 22—","heading":"FOREIGN RELATIONS AND INTERCOURSE","identifier":"/us/usc/t22"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 51—","heading":"PANAMA CANAL","identifier":"/us/usc/t22/ch51"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"SUBCHAPTER I—","heading":"ADMINISTRATION AND REGULATIONS","identifier":"/us/usc/t22/ch51/schI"},{"type":"part","num":"Part 2—","heading":"Employees","identifier":"/us/usc/t22/ch51/schI/pt2"},{"type":"subpart","num":"subpart ii—","heading":"wage and employment practices","identifier":"/us/usc/t22/ch51/schI/pt2/sptii"}]}